Remove the legacy mention push rules (`.m.rule.contains_display_name`, `.m.rule.contains_user_name` and `.m.rule.roomnotif`) from the base push rule set by default, as per Matrix v1.17 ([MSC4210](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4210)). See the [upgrade notes](https://element-hq.github.io/synapse/v1.161/upgrade.html#legacy-mention-push-rules-are-removed-by-default-msc4210).
